    <bpmn:process id="W_W1641" name="W1641. Returns Disposition Decision Engine &amp; Automation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Return processed through quality assessment (W1626, W1639)
Frequency: ~1,200 return dispositions/month (one per return — the ~40/day AR-credit-memo returns canon, per data-volumes §1.1)
Volume: Automated disposition for ~70% of returns; manual review for ~30%
Owner: Quality Manager
Participants: Quality Manager, DC Returns Coordinator, Category Managers
Source: workflow W1641 — Returns Disposition Decision Engine &amp; Automation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1641_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1641_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1641_Lane2" name="DC Returns Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1641_Lane3" name="Quality Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1641_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1641_Start5" name="Return processed through quality assessment (W1626, W1639)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1641_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1641_Task6" name="System applies automated disposition rules based on: (a) return reason code…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System applies automated disposition rules based on: (a) return reason code, (b) item category, (c) item condition assessment, (d) item value, (e) vendor RTV eligibility, (f) resale potential, (g) holding cost vs. recovery value
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1641_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1641_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1641_Task7" name="Unwanted/wrong size + good condition → Restock">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Automated disposition matrix: (a) Unwanted/wrong size + good condition → Restock: immediate return to available inventory, (b) Defective + vendor warranty → RTV: route to vendor return per W1631, (c) Damaged packaging + functional → Refurbish: route to refurbishment per W1640, (d) Damaged packaging + high value → Markdown: route to markdown per W93, (e) Safety issue → Recall hold: route to recall process per W1615, (f) Low value + damaged → Scrap: route to disposal per W91, (g) Seasonal + end of season → Liquidation: route to liquidation per W1642
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1641_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1641_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1641_Task8" name="Items falling outside automated rules (exceptions) routed to DC Returns…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Items falling outside automated rules (exceptions) routed to DC Returns Coordinator for manual disposition with Quality Manager guidance
Responsible (R): DC Returns Coordinator
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: 10 min/item</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1641_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1641_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1641_Task9" name="Quarterly: Quality Manager reviews disposition decision accuracy: (a) automated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly: Quality Manager reviews disposition decision accuracy: (a) automated disposition vs. actual outcome (did restocked items sell? were RTV credits recovered?), (b) tune rules for improved accuracy, (c) identify new disposition categories needed
Responsible (R): Quality Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1641_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1641_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1641_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1641_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1641_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-339 (ensure controlled execution — Reverse Logistics &amp; Disposition (PA-32.3).) | - operational: Quality Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Quality Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1641_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1641_Annotation11" targetRef="W1641_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
