    <bpmn:process id="W_W1643" name="W1643. Reverse Logistics Carrier &amp; Cost Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reverse logistics shipment created (store-to-DC, DC-to-vendor, DC-to-customer)
Frequency: ~1,000–1,500 reverse logistics shipments/month
Volume: ~250–375 per DC/month
Owner: Logistics Coordinator
Participants: Logistics Coordinator, DC Returns Coordinator, Finance
Source: workflow W1643 — Reverse Logistics Carrier &amp; Cost Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1643_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1643_Lane1" name="Logistics Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1643_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1643_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1643_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1643_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1643_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1643_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1643_Start4" name="Reverse logistics shipment created (store-to-DC, DC-to-vendor, DC-to-customer)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1643_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1643_Task5" name="Logistics Coordinator manages reverse logistics carriers: (a) store-to-DC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics Coordinator manages reverse logistics carriers: (a) store-to-DC: primarily backhaul on outbound delivery trucks (lowest cost), (b) DC-to-vendor: vendor-arranged pickup (vendor cost) or BuildRight carrier (negotiate vendor reimbursement), (c) DC-to-customer (ecommerce returns): 3PL carrier (Lalamove, Transportify)
Responsible (R): Logistics Coordinator
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1643_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1643_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1643_Task6" name="Cost allocation: system tracks reverse logistics cost per type: (a) carrier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cost allocation: system tracks reverse logistics cost per type: (a) carrier cost for RTV shipments (chargeable to vendor where possible), (b) backhaul cost (marginal — loaded on existing route), (c) 3PL cost for ecommerce returns (BuildRight cost — factored into ecommerce cost-to-serve), (d) internal handling cost (DC Returns Coordinator labor)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1643_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1643_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1643_Task7" name="Monthly: Logistics Coordinator and Controller review reverse logistics cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monthly: Logistics Coordinator and Controller review reverse logistics cost: (a) total cost by type, (b) cost as % of returns value, (c) carrier performance (damage rate, transit time), (d) vendor reimbursement recovery rate
Responsible (R): Logistics Coordinator / Controller
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / CFO
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1643_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1643_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
