    <bpmn:process id="W_W1644" name="W1644. Returns Financial Analytics &amp; Cost-to-Serve Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly financial close cycle
Frequency: Monthly reporting; quarterly executive review
Volume: Chain-wide aggregation of returns data
Owner: Controller
Participants: Controller, Quality Manager, VP Merchandising, VP Supply Chain, CFO
Source: workflow W1644 — Returns Financial Analytics &amp; Cost-to-Serve Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1644_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1644_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1644_Lane2" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1644_Lane3" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1644_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1644_Start5" name="Monthly financial close cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1644_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1644_Task6" name="System aggregates monthly returns financial data: (a) total returns value by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System aggregates monthly returns financial data: (a) total returns value by category, store, and channel, (b) return rate (% of sales by category), (c) recovery value (restock + refurbish + RTV credit + liquidation), (d) unrecoverable cost (scrap + markdown loss + handling cost), (e) reverse logistics cost (carrier + handling + refurbishment), (f) cost-to-serve per return (total returns cost ÷ number of returns)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1644_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1644_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1644_Task7" name="Controller reviews returns financial report: (a) net return cost as % of gross…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Controller reviews returns financial report: (a) net return cost as % of gross revenue (target: &lt; 1.5%), (b) trend analysis (monthly, quarterly, YoY), (c) top 10 SKUs by return cost, (d) top 10 stores by return rate, (e) recovery rate by disposition type
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1644_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1644_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1644_Task8" name="Quarterly: Controller presents returns financial analytics to executive team…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly: Controller presents returns financial analytics to executive team: (a) total returns cost impact on margin, (b) root cause analysis linking return reasons to quality/vendor/category issues, (c) recommendations: vendor quality improvement, product specification changes, packaging improvements, policy changes
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1644_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1644_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1644_Task9" name="Cross-functional action planning: VP Merchandising, VP Supply Chain, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Cross-functional action planning: VP Merchandising, VP Supply Chain, and Quality Manager review top return drivers and implement corrective actions: (a) vendor quality improvement (W1610), (b) product specification or packaging changes, (c) customer education (improved product information, how-to guides), (d) return policy adjustments for specific categories
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / VP Supply Chain
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1644_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1644_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1644_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1644_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1644_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-339 (ensure controlled execution — Reverse Logistics &amp; Disposition (PA-32.3).) | - operational: Controller review and approval gate
Owner: Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1644_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1644_Annotation11" targetRef="W1644_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
